{"id":"323381492f97cb49","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-kurtz-random.md","title":"Kurtz 随机性","display":"df-kurtz-random — Kurtz 随机性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-kurtz-random","aliases":["20-df-kurtz-random"],"display":"df-kurtz-random — Kurtz 随机性","chapter":"11","section":"11.4","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Definition 11.4.3 及随后的等价刻画","source_pdf_pages":[224],"source_printed_pages":[193],"depends_on":["[[20-df-closed-class]]","[[20-df-cantor-measure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-kurtz-random"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-kurtz-random</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-kurtz-random — Kurtz 随机性"},{"key":"chapter","html":"11"},{"key":"section","html":"11.4"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 11.4.3 及随后的等价刻画"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>224</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>193</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b73290a0af01d44f\" href=\"?note=b73290a0af01d44f\" title=\"20-df-closed-class\">20-df-closed-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"978bb51599bc5702\" href=\"?note=978bb51599bc5702\" title=\"20-df-cantor-measure\">20-df-cantor-measure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b73290a0af01d44f\" href=\"?note=b73290a0af01d44f\" title=\"20-df-closed-class\">20-df-closed-class</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"978bb51599bc5702\" href=\"?note=978bb51599bc5702\" title=\"20-df-cantor-measure\">20-df-cantor-measure</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kurtz\\text{-}random}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{KurtzRandom}(X)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall C\\ [\\operatorname{Pi01Class}(C)\\land\\mu(C)=0\\Rightarrow X\\notin C].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kurtz\\text{-}random}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{KurtzRandom}(X)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall C\\ [\\operatorname{Pi01Class}(C)\\land\\mu(C)=0\\Rightarrow X\\notin C].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是原书有效 clopen 检验定义的等价形式，又称 weakly 1-random。与 weak 1-generic 的术语不同。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 11.4.3 及随后的等价刻画；印刷页 193；PDF 第 224 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-closed-class","status":"resolved","id":"b73290a0af01d44f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-closed-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-cantor-measure","status":"resolved","id":"978bb51599bc5702","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-cantor-measure]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-closed-class","status":"resolved","id":"b73290a0af01d44f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-closed-class]]；see [[20-df-cantor-measure]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-cantor-measure","status":"resolved","id":"978bb5159